itor's note cites \"alternative boundary clearances and site cover provisions for Class 1 and 10 structures under section 33\". Table 5.6.1 makes standalone Class 10a building work accepted subject to requirements against these AOs.\nResearcher notes: Habitable accommodation buildings limb (a) omitted (out of scope). For the Emerging Community Zone the table applies only outside a Local Plan or approved structure plan area. In the Rural Zone AO5.1 applies everywhere except the Yaamba Historic Township Precinct."}$q$::jsonb);
