es AO6.1, AO8.1, AO9.1, AO9.2 and AO10.1 to standalone Class 10a building work in the Yaamba Historic Township Precinct. Dwelling houses here are code assessable (Table 5.4.4.4). The ZONE-level raw scope for \"Rural Zone\" also covers this precinct; curator should make the precinct rule override the zone-wide Schedule 10 rules."}$q$::jsonb);
